{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52431","headline":"回波乐 七十四 · 王梵志","name":"回波乐 七十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"身是五阴（一作「荫」）城，周廻无里数。\n上下九穴门，脓流皆臭瘀。\n湛然脓血间，安置八万户。\n余有九（一作「四」）千家，出没同居住。\n攘攘相食噉，贴贴无言语。\n总在粪尿中，不解相蛆姡。\n身行城即移，身卧城稳具（一作「住」）。\n身死城破坏，百姓无安处。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52431.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52431","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}